{"id": "1801632", "name": "בעיית קיצון – זמן מינימלי בשחייה ובהליכה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.62; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V5_VALIDATION_FIX\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">בעיית קיצון – זמן מינימלי בשחייה ובהליכה</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 9px;\">הנתונים</div>\n<p>רוחב הנהר הוא <strong>{{CT:0}}</strong> ק״מ, והבית נמצא במרחק <strong>{{CT:1}}</strong> ק״מ לאורך הגדה מן הנקודה שמול נקודת ההתחלה.</p>\n<p>מהירות השחייה היא <strong>{{CT:2}}</strong> קמ״ש ומהירות ההליכה <strong>{{CT:3}}</strong> קמ״ש. נסמן ב־\\(\\displaystyle x\\) את המרחק לאורך הגדה עד נקודת היציאה מן המים. מצאו את \\(\\displaystyle x\\) שממזער את זמן ההגעה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 9px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #E8E2EB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px; box-sizing: border-box; ;text-align: center;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V5_VALIDATION_FIX\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון</div>\n<p>זמן השחייה וזמן ההליכה הם</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle T_s\\left(x\\right)=\\frac{\\sqrt{{{CT:4}}^2+x^2}}{{{CT:5}}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle T_w\\left(x\\right)=\\frac{{{CT:6}}-x}{{{CT:7}}}\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle T\\left(x\\right)={{CT:8}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle T'\\left(x\\right)={{CT:9}}\\)</div>\n<p>נקודה קריטית מתקבלת מן המשוואה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{x}{{{CT:5}}\\sqrt{{{CT:4}}^2+x^2}}=\\frac1{{{CT:7}}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_*={{CT:10}}\\)</div>\n<p>אם \\(\\displaystyle x_*\\le{{CT:6}}\\), הנגזרת מחליפה סימן משלילי לחיובי ולכן זהו המינימום. אם \\(\\displaystyle x_*&gt;{{CT:6}}\\), הפונקציה יורדת בכל הקטע \\(\\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le{{CT:6}}\\), ולכן המינימום מתקבל בקצה \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:6}}\\).</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\boxed{x={{CT:11}}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["extremum", "ll", "params", "tLand", "tRiver", "tTotal", "tTotalPrime", "ta", "uu", "vv", "ww"], "nvariants": 50}